OL,3,ABBC to cut raft of Radio 4 programmes
OL,4,Aincluding You and Yours
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC has announced it will be
OL,7,Fcutting a raft of Radio 4 programmes
OL,8,Fincluding the long-running consumer and
OL,9,Fsocial affairs show You and Yours.
OL,11,FThe social sciences show Thinking
OL,12,FAllowed will also be cut along with
OL,13,Farts and ideas programme Free Thinking,
OL,14,Fas the corporation seeks #500m savings.
OL,16,FOther shows such The Artificial Human
OL,17,Fand Open Country will also go, it was
OL,18,Fannounced on Thursday, while Radio 5
OL,19,FLive will also see a reduction in
OL,20,Fcommissioning on its schedule and
OL,21,Fpodcasts.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
